{{Splblocknotes
| name = Adaptive Strike
| desc = Blocks the ability cast completely upon {{M|projectile}} impact.
}}
{{Disjointnotes
| name = Adaptive Strike
| desc = Reflects the ability cast upon {{M|projectile}} impact.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Adaptive Strike
| desc = Both Adaptive Strikes are independent and draftable abilities.
}}

 * The ability effects are applied as follows upon {{M|projectile}} impact:
*# Checks Morphling's current {{M|attributes}} upon projectile impact, {{Code|d}} and {{Code|k}} adapts linearly correspondingly to the Morphling's current total {{M|agility}} to {{M|strength}} ratio.
*# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} is defined as:
*#* {{cf|expr}} {{Code|SpellDmg {{=}} {{#var:Adaptive Strike value1}} + Σ[[Agility|Agi]] × d}}
*#** The damage factor ({{Code|d}}) has two main ability formulas:
*#*** {{Code|When ΣAgi × {{#var:Adaptive Strike type1 value1}} < Σ[[Strength|Str]] , d {{=}} {{#var:Adaptive Strike type1 value2}}}}
*#*** {{Code|When ΣAgi × {{#var:Adaptive Strike type1 value1}} > ΣStr , d {{=}} {{#var:Adaptive Strike type1 value3}}}}
*# {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
*#* Applies a {{Code|k}}-distance offensive non-disabling [[forced movement]].

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
*** The knockback distance ({{Code|k}}) has two main ability formulas:
**** {{Code|When Σ[[Strength|Str]] < Σ[[Agility|Agi]] × {{#var:Adaptive Strike type2 value1}} , k {{=}} {{#var:Adaptive Strike type2 value2}}}}
**** {{Code|When ΣStr > ΣAgi × {{#var:Adaptive Strike type2 value1}} , k {{=}} {{#var:Adaptive Strike type2 value3}}}}
** {{Symbol|Stun}}
*** Applies a [[stun]] ({{Code|s}}) on the debuff-affected enemy unit, and is defined as:
**** {{Code|When ΣStr > ΣAgi × {{#var:Adaptive Strike type2 value1}} , s {{=}} {{#var:Adaptive Strike type2 value5}}}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Adaptive Strike icon0}}
| desc = Launches a surge of water toward an enemy unit, stunning them, knocking them back, and dealing base damage plus additional damage based on Morphling's agility times a multiplier.  If Morphling's agility is 50% higher than strength, the maximum agility multiplier is used.<br><br>Knockback distance and stun duration are based on Morphling's strength. If his strength is 50% higher than his agility, the maximum knockback distance and stun duration is used.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Adaptive Strike basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

